// The mystery box's Ray Gun (SJK's own, docs/mystery-boxes.md): held 30 seconds by a box's
// opener, never chosen as a prop gun. Read by propgun.rs from sjk/raygun.gun.
name "Ray Gun"
view models/sjk/raygun.md3
viewOffset 0 0 -1
world models/sjk/raygun.md3
worldScale 0.9
fire sound/sjk/raygun/fire.wav
impact sound/sjk/raygun/impact.wav
raise sound/sjk/raygun/raise.wav
boltModel models/sjk/raygun_bolt.md3
boltColor 0.35 1 0.25
boltLight 180
boltSpeed 2200
boltLife 1500
fireEffect disruptor/muzzle_flash
refire 450
push 1300
